{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22476","headline":"登龙昌上寺望江南山怀钱舍人 · 白居易","name":"登龙昌上寺望江南山怀钱舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骑马出西郭，悠悠欲何之。\n独上高寺去，一与白云期。\n虚槛晚潇洒，前山碧参差。\n忽似青龙合，同望玉峰时。\n因咏松雪句，永怀鸾鹤姿。\n六年不相见，况乃隔荣衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}